<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Bridger returns six months after intake. He drives into town again and spent the harvest picking apples from a low ladder with a neighbor holding it. His back pain averages about 2 out of 10 on his home exercises and he has not needed any pain tablets. His knees ache after a long day on the slopes. He has had no falls. He has no trouble swallowing or breathing and his voice is unchanged. His hepatitis C and hepatitis B tests from the wellness visit were negative, and he was told by phone. He saw audiology, who found mild hearing loss in the left ear, and dermatology, who froze several rough spots on his hands. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Back pain</td><td>2 out of 10</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>PHQ-9 1</td></tr><tr><td>Falls</td><td>None</td></tr><tr><td>Goiter</td><td>No pressure symptoms</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

